#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the following modeling techniques in CarSim:
#
#1. A D-Class SUV performing an evasize steering maneuver to avoid the merging full-size SUV while driving on a road that decreases from two lanes to one.
#
#2. The D-Class SUV does not have an ESC system.
#
#3. How to create variable width roads with features such as a four-lane highway with drainage ditches and road crown.
#
#Note that in this example, the vehicles steer independently of one another; there is no interaction between the two vehicles.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

